{
  "pack": {
    "name": "pixelet-ms2-inspired-original",
    "description": "Original individual 64x64 terrain and object textures for pixelet. All active assets use an original hand-painted fantasy-game visual style. The 15 object block textures share one generic painted plaster/stucco architectural material and differ only by palette color. The existing filenames are retained only for code compatibility. It is an original design and does not copy MapleStory 2 or any other game.",
    "tileSize": 64,
    "format": "PNG",
    "filesAreIndividual": true,
    "activeAssetCount": 60,
    "cutePaintedActiveCount": 60,
    "legacyActiveCount": 0,
    "allActiveAssetsUseCutePaintedStyle": true,
    "sourcePalette": {
      "terrain": "pixelet terrain/carto.json",
      "objects": "pixelet objects/default.json"
    },
    "note": "Download each active source image as an individual file and normalize it to exactly 64x64 RGBA PNG. For these hand-painted assets, use high-quality Lanczos or bicubic downsampling when the source is larger than 64x64; do not use nearest-neighbor on the painted set because it can reintroduce visible pixelation. Do not make a sprite sheet. The cute-painted set covers all 17 land/water top materials, all 5 structure tops, all 10 transport tops, and all 13 terrain sides. The SEA, LAKE, RIVER, and WETLAND water entries were refreshed with a calmer pastel-painted water treatment: broad soft tonal drift, restrained contrast, and no strong repeated ripple pattern. The RAIL_MAIN and RAIL_SUBWAY transport entries were refreshed with an isotropic rail-ballast treatment with no directional lines, since a single stamped tile cannot be rotated to match each way's real bearing. All 15 object block textures now use the shared generic-painted-plaster-stucco-v1 material. The existing filenames are retained only for code compatibility; none of the active block textures represent wool or fiber. Each color keeps its existing paletteHex and has its own individual PNG (60 cute-painted, 0 legacy = 60 active assets total). Preserve distinct-per-type mappings and do not collapse types. The old sourceCreation 28 exposed-soil image is intentionally excluded and must not be assigned to any terrain type.",
    "conversion": {
      "status": "complete",
      "cutePaintedGroups": [
        "terrain.top.land",
        "terrain.top.water",
        "terrain.top.structure",
        "terrain.top.transport",
        "terrain.side",
        "objects.block"
      ],
      "legacyGroups": [],
      "cutePaintedAssetCount": 60,
      "legacyAssetCount": 0,
      "remainingForCutePaintedConversion": 0,
      "fullPackComplete": true,
      "note": "The pack is now fully converted to the active painted style. All 17 land/water top materials, 5 structure tops, 10 transport tops, 13 terrain sides, and 15 object blocks are active. The 15 object blocks share the generic-painted-plaster-stucco-v1 architectural surface rule and differ only by palette color. The existing filenames remain unchanged for compatibility. The calm-water variants remain active, and the old sourceCreation 28 exposed-soil image remains excluded."
    }
  },
